      "id": "claim_4d8511e0c05e494796c0348cb811a952",
      "statement": "The repository has three source-to-generated documentation pipelines: hx-fleet.tsv → every HX-FLEET:TABLE block plus hx-fleet-ips.env (via hx-fleet); hx-proof.tsv → every HX-PROOF:TABLE block plus the HX-PROOF:DAG diagram in the smoke-test roadmap (via hx-proof); docs/**/*.md → human-html/ mirrors (via hx-render-html). openwiki/ is a fourth generated tree produced by the scheduled OpenWiki Action.",
